  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Runs a standard OSCA-style single-cell pipeline in WebAssembly inside the browser on an uploaded count matrix, then lets you explore the embedding, clusters and marker genes and export the results. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
